```
https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200
```

## Arredondamento

| Token | Valor |
|---|---|
| sm | 0.25rem (4px) |
| DEFAULT | 0.5rem (8px) |
| md | 0.75rem (12px) |
| lg | 1rem (16px) |
| xl | 1.5rem (24px) |
| full | 9999px |

## Espaçamento

- Grid base: **8px** com micro-steps de 4px
- Gutter mobile: `16px` | tablet: `24px`
- Max content width: `560px` (centrado em telas maiores)
- Touch target mínimo: `48×48px`, primário: `56px`
- Card padding: sm `12px`, md `16px`, lg `20px`

## Elevação (Tonal Charcoal Stacking)

- **Layer 0 (Canvas):** `#121316`
- **Layer 1 (Cards):** `#1B1B1F` (surface-container-low)
- **Layer 2 (Overlays):** `#22252B` + `1px solid rgba(255,107,0,0.22)`
- **Accent Glow:** `box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(255,107,0,0.28)`
- **Slit Cutouts:** Divider 1px `surface-variant` (`#343538`)
- **Top Edge Highlight:** `bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-primary-container to-transparent` h=2px

## Componentes

### Botões
- **Primário (CTA):** bg `#FF6B00` (primary-container), texto `#0D0E11` (surface-container-lowest), height `52px`, glow `0 4px 14px rgba(255,107,0,0.35)`, Barlow Condensed bold uppercase, tracking wider
- **Secundário:** bg `surface-container-high` (`#292A2D`), texto `on-surface`, hover `surface-bright`, rounded-lg
- **Link/Accent:** texto `primary-container` (`#FF6B00`), hover `primary` (`#FFB693`)

### Cards
- bg `surface-container-low` (`#1B1B1F`), rounded-xl (`1.5rem`)
- Top edge: gradient line `from-transparent via-primary-container to-transparent` (2px)
- Shadow: `shadow-xl`

### Inputs
- bg `surface-container-lowest` (`#0D0E11`)
- Texto: `on-surface` (`#E3E2E6`)
- Placeholder: `outline` com 60% opacidade
- Ícone à esquerda: Material Symbols, cor `outline` (`#A98A7D`), 20px
- Focus: bg `surface-container`, texto `primary`
- Labels: `label-md` style, uppercase, tracking-wider, cor `on-surface`
- Hints: `body-sm`, cor `outline`

### Divisor (Slit Cutout)
- Linha 1px `surface-variant` (`#343538`)
- Label central: bg do card, `label-md`, cor `outline`, uppercase, tracking-wider

### Chips/Filtros
- Height `32px`, pill radius, bg `#22252B`
- Inativo: label `outline` | Ativo: border e label `#FF6B00`